**House Kawoo** (/'*kɔːoː*/, *[[arethian|Arethian]]*: Κωο) are one of the four [[enkoan-trading-houses|Enkoan Trading Houses]].  They are the head of the Farreach Mercantile and they are famous for their exotic goods. They are able to trade these because of their great diplomatic relations.

## Etymology
A amalgamation of *Kawkhna*, meaning far, and *Boiskoo*, meaning money.
 
## History
[[house-kawoo|House Kawoo]] was founded by Cael Kawoo. As one of the sons of Wylan Seagrin, he inherited the prowess in diplomacy and negotiation from his father. Using this skill, Farreach Mercantile established connections in the most far reaching exotic places there are.
